Body:
Interesting that this is happening to me too, but seems to be model dependant.

`MiMo V2.5` (`openrouter/xiaomi/mimo-v2.5`) started doing this, but swapping to another model still works.

Uninstalling and reinstalling openrouter does not fix.

Neither does removing the entire `~/.local/share/openrouter`, `~/.config/openrouter` and `~/.cache/opencode` folders.

(MiMo was previously working just fine)

## Fixed:

`~/.config/opencode/config.json`
```json
{
  "provider": {
    "openrouter": {
      "models": {
        "xiaomi/mimo-v2.5": {
          "limit": {
            "context": 1000000,
            "output": 1000000
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

`openrouter` was returning incorrect context for that model. Upstream bug.
